  "findings": [
    "Fixed32MiB owner kind is selected in original policy and preparation/restore registry; signed HeadBytes may grow logical capacity without changing physical owner identity.",
    "Legacy standalone monitor wrappers retain1MiB; combined reference allowances are private fields derived from original policy.",
    "Complete witness is exercised through head publication, exact archival bytes, original reader and public physical restore/semantic decode.",
    "Actual1024/2048 fixture vectors include every identity and every node/weights/bonds row, with extraUID zero stake; this is not evidence of dense full-population workloads or production host sizing.",
    "Captured original parent proof is drained and actual accrual/replay is preserved; no runtime or10/90 authority follows from synthetic execution.",
    "Physical-profile and entitlement joins must update every clone/reference reader and retain complete native-owner restore scope."
  ],
